6,A Trans superstar of South Pacific music- I'm Moshanty,https://www.losangelesblade.com/2020/12/15/a-trans-superstar-of-south-pacific-music-im-moshanty/,"August 27, 2021 - At an early age, Moshanty grew up with parents who were pastors, and although one might jump to the conclusion that pastors in Papua New Guinea might be against Moshanty coming out as trans, the documentary shows her parents as being caring and loving. Moshanty’s mother says, “The scriptures say “do not judge.” Moshanty commented on people preaching hate by saying, “If there is no love, what’s the point of preaching about love on the pulpit if you have all that hate in you?” · Moshanty capitalized on her voice by becoming a musician and songwriter.",Nomu,Trans-New Guinea
